WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.800
Two figures face off like fencers.

2
00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:05.000
Every line is a blade.

3
00:00:05.050 --> 00:00:08.590
She strikes first: "I wonder
that you will still be talking,

4
00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:11.420
Signior Benedick: nobody marks you."

5
00:00:11.470 --> 00:00:13.300
He fires back: "What!

6
00:00:13.350 --> 00:00:16.630
my dear Lady Disdain, are you yet living?"

7
00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:21.640
Her uncle says they "never meet but
there’s a skirmish of wit between them."

8
00:00:21.690 --> 00:00:24.310
Insults at every meeting in Act 1.

9
00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:26.170
Married by Act 5.

10
00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:27.840
So how do they get there?

11
00:00:27.890 --> 00:00:31.390
In this mission, you'll learn
the moves of their "merry war":

12
00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:34.450
quick, twisting replies called repartee.

13
00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:37.440
You'll ask whether this is
really their first fight.

14
00:00:37.490 --> 00:00:40.090
And you'll ask whether,
under all the jokes,

15
00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:42.260
either of them is really hurt.

16
00:00:42.310 --> 00:00:45.580
Your mission: work out
why they end up married.
